# cron.example — example crontab entry to launch jarvis triage loop on a schedule.
#
# Default mode is SUPERVISED: Claude scans and produces a plan, then STOPS and
# awaits human authorization before taking any action. No Aone writes occur
# without explicit per-item approval.
#
# To use: run `crontab -e` and uncomment + adapt the line below.
# Replace /path/to/jarvis with the absolute path to your cloned repo.
#
# UNATTENDED mode must be explicitly enabled in autonomy.md ("mode":"unattended").
# Do NOT enable unattended unless you fully understand the consequences —
# the loop will take actions without human confirmation.
#
# Run at 09:00 every weekday (Mon–Fri), supervised by default:
# 0 9 * * 1-5 cd /path/to/jarvis && claude --no-ui "run the triage loop"
#
# 注:reconcile(stale/orphan/drift)兜底不走 cron —— 常驻 bridge 进程内置
# ReconcileScheduler 已周期自动跑(见 bridge/jarvis_dingtalk_bot.py,随 bridge/run.sh
# start 起来即生效,无需手动装 crontab)。只在「不跑 bridge 的机器」上才需要在这里
# 自行加 `bash bootstrap/reconcile.sh all` 的定时行。
